      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS DE MEDICI (2) is backing up seven days after finishing second over 1100m at Warwick. Drawn to get all the favours from the inside alley. Good effort last start and is expected to go well again. DEEP TIARA (5) ran a strong race last time out, finishing second and beaten only a neck over 1200m at Toowoomba after being prominent at the turn. Well placed and there is no reason why she cannot find winning ways. The well-related ZARIPPA (4) (half to 2xG3 winner I'm A Rippa) took advantage of a low draw last time and stalked the lead before going on to score by a nose over 1100m at Warwick. Winning rider Jess Emmerson stays aboard. Should be involved in the finish. STRAIGHT BLAST (3) is a progressive galloper who is first-up since finishing fifth over 1200m at this track six-and-a-half months ago. Fitter for a recent trial win. Has won when fresh from a spell in the past and shouldn't be underestimated.",
